{
  "slug": "atelier",
  "name": "Atelier",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Universal multi-agent project harness for Claude Code — run any project through a structured AI team from discovery to release.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**, **8 agents** and **7 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `add-agent` (Add a new project-specific agent mid-project, with Chief AI Officer drafting the definition and justification, and the user…), `add-mcp` (Add a new MCP server to the project mid-project), `add-skill` (Add a new project-specific skill mid-project), `escalate` (Re-activate a Phase 1 agent from STANDBY because a requirement, design, roadmap, team-composition, or documentation drift has been…), `hotfix` (Produce a production hotfix — branch from main, fix, change-review back into main, then merge the fix back…), `init-project` (Initialize a new project with a structured, multi-agent workflow — discovery interview, operating preferences, technical design, agent team…), `kanban` (Render the active milestone's tasks as a kanban board grouped by lane (backlog / todo / in-progress /…), `milestone-checkpoint` (Run a milestone completion checkpoint — summarize what was delivered against the milestone's success criteria, surface risks and…), and 4 more\n- **Agents** (8): `chief-ai-officer` (Use in Phase 1 (primary) to design the project-specific agent team — choosing which domain engineers to create,…), `product-manager` (Use in Phase 1 (primary) to conduct discovery interviews, elicit requirements, define stakeholders, and set measurable success criteria), `project-manager` (Use in Phase 1 (primary) to decompose the scope into milestones, tasks, and a dependency graph, and to…), `qa-engineer` (Use in Phase 2 as a PR reviewer focused on requirements and roadmap alignment — verifying the PR…), `senior-software-engineer` (Use in Phase 2 as a PR reviewer focused on code quality — style, correctness, error handling, edge…), `software-architect` (Use in Phase 1 (primary) to select the technology stack, design system architecture, define module boundaries, data models,…), `tech-lead` (Use in Phase 2 as a PR reviewer focused on architectural and technical alignment — verifying the implementation…), `technical-writer` (Use in Phase 1 (primary, closing step) and continuously in Phase 2 to organize the documentation tree, maintain…)\n- **Hooks** (7): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `Notification`, `PreCompact`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install atelier@claude-community` from `dudgns0908/atelier` (`atelier`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 12,
    "agent": 8,
    "hook": 7
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
